<title>USA: Westport Bancorp holders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Westport Bancorp holders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westport Bancorp Inc said on Friday that its shareholders approved a merger with HUBCO Inc at the Westport's October 24 meeting.</p>
<p>Each Westport share will be converted into 0.332175 of a share of HUBCO common stock and each outstanding share of Wesport series A convertible preferred stock will be converted into one share of a new series of HUBCO preferred stock, Westport said.</p>
<p>The merger is expected to close in mid-December, Westport said.</p>
</text>
